1
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:34,940
[In my prime]

2
00:01:35,250 --> 00:01:37,729
[Episode 11]

3
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:38,680
Aunt.

4
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,400
I wish I had a mom

5
00:01:40,430 --> 00:01:41,070
like you.

6
00:01:41,759 --> 00:01:42,350
I don't want

7
00:01:42,350 --> 00:01:43,680
a daughter as old as you.

8
00:01:46,229 --> 00:01:47,759
My boyfriend is calling me.

9
00:01:48,590 --> 00:01:49,000
Hello?

10
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:55,320
What did you just say?

11
00:01:57,479 --> 00:01:58,740
I didn't say anything.

12
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,660
I'm starving to death.

13
00:02:01,950 --> 00:02:03,140
Is the food ready?

14
00:02:03,510 --> 00:02:05,170
The food is warming in the pot.

15
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:06,560
It's going to get cold tomorrow.

16
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:08,110
I knitted a sweater for you.

17
00:02:08,930 --> 00:02:10,360
You're growing so fast now,

18
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:12,470
I'm not sure about the size.

19
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:12,960
No need.

20
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,650
Don't move!

21
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:14,000
No,

22
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:15,630
no rush to knit it, Mom.

23
00:02:16,150 --> 00:02:16,750
My aunt

24
00:02:16,930 --> 00:02:17,650
bought me

25
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:18,910
a new sweater. Look.

26
00:02:19,750 --> 00:02:20,680
It's cashmere.

27
00:02:20,710 --> 00:02:21,960
Imported from abroad.

28
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:22,520
Looks good, right?

29
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:23,680
It feels so soft.

30
00:02:24,140 --> 00:02:25,079
I'm going to wear it to school

31
00:02:25,079 --> 00:02:25,680
tomorrow.

32
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:26,710
Look,

33
00:02:27,590 --> 00:02:28,850
the color is so pretty.

34
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:30,190
What do you think?

35
00:02:46,150 --> 00:02:48,310
This world is ever-changing.

36
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:50,010
Everyone is different.

37
00:02:50,140 --> 00:02:50,810
There is no

38
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,570
single standard to measure it.

39
00:02:53,079 --> 00:02:53,910
Don't be fooled

40
00:02:53,910 --> 00:02:55,400
by those gossips.

41
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,460
You are the one who decides

42
00:02:57,590 --> 00:02:58,790
if you are beautiful.

43
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:01,190
As long as you are capable,

44
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:02,710
no one in this world

45
00:03:02,710 --> 00:03:04,150
will look down on you.

46
00:03:30,870 --> 00:03:32,710
My name is Lucy.

47
00:03:34,470 --> 00:03:35,470
I'm a girl

48
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:41,030
who has inherited the legacy
of the Flower Angel.

49
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,270
I'm off.

50
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,070
Mom,

51
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,750
Hurry and give me the sweater
you knitted me.

52
00:05:00,750 --> 00:05:01,750
It's freezing.

53
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,110
Looks like that imported

54
00:05:04,110 --> 00:05:04,960
cash-what...

55
00:05:05,070 --> 00:05:05,830
Cashmere.

56
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:06,950
Cashmere (goat's wool).

57
00:05:06,950 --> 00:05:09,390
It can't keep out Qingwu's strong winds.

58
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,530
Of course.

59
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,830
A sweater knitted by my mom

60
00:05:12,830 --> 00:05:13,720
is definitely the best.

61
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:15,380
Alright, stop flattering me.

62
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,800
Hurry up and put it on.

63
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,120
Haven't you shown off enough

64
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,180
since we were kids?

65
00:05:39,270 --> 00:05:41,070
Shouldn't you be studying hard
in 11th grade?

66
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:42,600
It's precisely because we're in 11th grade

67
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:44,260
that I don't want any regrets.

68
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,720
When senior year comes,

69
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:47,380
the workload will be heavier,

70
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:49,360
and we'll have even fewer chances.

71
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,180
Just sign up for it.

72
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:10,160
Yeah, that's amazing.

73
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,620
Not really, just average.

74
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:12,920
It's 136.

75
00:06:13,950 --> 00:06:15,680
Here's one that's even higher.

76
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,270
So impressive.

77
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:19,530
What's the score for the essay this time?

78
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,220
That's so good.

79
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,380
I'll try to beat him next time.

80
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:32,470
He must have gotten extra tutoring.

81
00:06:32,470 --> 00:06:33,270
I think so.

82
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:34,830
Super impressive.

83
00:06:34,830 --> 00:06:35,950
He's improved so much.

84
00:06:35,950 --> 00:06:37,810
But he won't have as much freedom.

85
00:06:38,510 --> 00:06:39,310
But with this score,

86
00:06:39,310 --> 00:06:40,750
if your mom sees it, she'll probably

87
00:06:40,750 --> 00:06:42,680
make you go to a cram school, right?

88
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,600
I only scored 623,

89
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,750
and that was only second place.

90
00:06:47,750 --> 00:06:48,430
Then you should beat

91
00:06:48,430 --> 00:06:50,080
the top student in your class.

92
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:51,740
My mom will probably scold me.

93
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:53,310
Your mom still scolds you?

94
00:06:53,310 --> 00:06:54,430
You got 666?

95
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,240
Does your mom expect you

96
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:59,640
to get into Tsinghua or Peking University?

97
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:00,980
Put all the desks back.

98
00:07:03,070 --> 00:07:03,720
Miss.

99
00:07:05,830 --> 00:07:06,430
What is it?

100
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,040
Miss.

101
00:07:07,510 --> 00:07:08,460
I want to sign up.

102
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:10,180
It's already full.

103
00:07:10,630 --> 00:07:12,490
Why don't you try again next year?

104
00:07:12,490 --> 00:07:13,920
Sign up earlier next year,

105
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:15,320
and you'll have a chance.

106
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:20,650
I'll be in 12th grade next year.

107
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:23,120
How could I have a chance?

108
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,310
Guys,

109
00:07:41,409 --> 00:07:43,240
the audition for The Story
of the Flower Fairy

110
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,240
is about to begin.

111
00:07:44,630 --> 00:07:46,830
Please get ready if your name is called.

112
00:07:47,159 --> 00:07:47,480
Su Yife.

113
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,040
Hurry up.

114
00:07:48,060 --> 00:07:48,420
Here.

115
00:07:49,630 --> 00:07:51,000
I didn't even sign up.

116
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,370
Why did you drag me here?

117
00:07:52,750 --> 00:07:54,080
To watch the auditions.

118
00:07:54,159 --> 00:07:54,510
Here.

119
00:07:54,510 --> 00:07:56,370
I don't like being part of a crowd.

120
00:07:56,430 --> 00:07:57,860
Just think of it as cheering Tianji on.

121
00:07:57,860 --> 00:07:59,520
You guys come in with me first.

122
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:01,620
The rest of you, please wait a moment.

123
00:08:02,390 --> 00:08:03,590
Four-eyes, go for it.

124
00:08:08,190 --> 00:08:09,180
Why aren't they out yet?

125
00:08:09,180 --> 00:08:10,040
Here they come.

126
00:08:11,070 --> 00:08:11,750
Look at him.

127
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:13,290
How did it go?

128
00:08:13,310 --> 00:08:14,440
Did you get the part?

129
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:16,330
I didn't get the prince's role,

130
00:08:16,650 --> 00:08:17,450
but I did get

131
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,000
a bizarre role.

132
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,070
A horse.

133
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:20,430
No!

134
00:08:20,430 --> 00:08:22,270
The role of the prince has been cast.

135
00:08:22,270 --> 00:08:23,310
Next is the audition

136
00:08:23,310 --> 00:08:24,680
for the Flower Fairy.

137
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,330
Li Miaomiao.

138
00:08:27,510 --> 00:08:27,840
Here.

139
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,000
Zhao Jiaxin.

140
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:29,330
Here.

141
00:08:29,870 --> 00:08:30,830
Liang Tiantian.

142
00:08:30,950 --> 00:08:31,280
Here.

143
00:08:31,310 --> 00:08:32,870
Shouldn't you have auditioned
for the prince?

144
00:08:32,870 --> 00:08:33,630
Zhao Ranran.

145
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:34,049
Here.

146
00:08:35,750 --> 00:08:36,360
Qi Shi.

147
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,120
Qi Shi.

148
00:08:41,150 --> 00:08:42,120
Come in with me.

149
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,200
Go.

150
00:08:44,550 --> 00:08:45,550
I didn't sign up.

151
00:08:46,630 --> 00:08:47,690
I signed up for you.

152
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:51,000
I saw you memorizing lines
at home every day,

153
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,660
not even watching TV anymore.

154
00:08:52,910 --> 00:08:54,640
You must really want to do this.

155
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:57,170
I managed to sign you up
at the last minute.

156
00:08:58,240 --> 00:08:58,790
All right.

157
00:08:58,790 --> 00:08:59,810
Thank me when you come out.

158
00:08:59,810 --> 00:09:00,260
Go on.

159
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:00,870
Go.

160
00:09:01,030 --> 00:09:01,670
Hurry up.

161
00:09:01,750 --> 00:09:02,270
You got this.

162
00:09:02,270 --> 00:09:03,530
Hurry up. You got this.

163
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:05,600
Don't be nervous.

164
00:09:07,550 --> 00:09:08,960
Not bad, Cao.

165
00:09:09,070 --> 00:09:10,270
When did you sign up?

166
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:11,840
Guess.

167
00:09:14,550 --> 00:09:15,360
This role is

168
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:16,720
very challenging for me.

169
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:18,340
So what exactly are you playing?

170
00:09:18,340 --> 00:09:19,140
It's a secret.

171
00:09:22,620 --> 00:09:24,080
What if she doesn't get chosen?

172
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,480
Stop hovering around me.

173
00:09:25,870 --> 00:09:26,400
Whenever

174
00:09:26,670 --> 00:09:27,470
I get nervous,

175
00:09:27,590 --> 00:09:29,050
I need to use the bathroom.

176
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,770
Why isn't Qi Shi out yet?

177
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:37,440
Maybe she got into an argument

178
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,600
with the teacher.

179
00:09:40,050 --> 00:09:41,530
Maybe she's crying.

180
00:09:43,330 --> 00:09:44,240
As her good friends,

181
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:44,930
we need to figure out

182
00:09:44,930 --> 00:09:46,330
how to comfort her later.

183
00:09:48,630 --> 00:09:49,490
Here she comes.

184
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,170
How did it go?

185
00:09:58,630 --> 00:09:59,430
Didn't get it?

186
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:08,510
It's okay.

187
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:10,610
We can try again next time.

188
00:10:11,790 --> 00:10:12,960
Don't dwell on it.

189
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:14,900
Think about something happy.

190
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:17,670
I just downloaded a new TV show.

191
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:20,620
We can watch it together when we get home.

192
00:10:24,550 --> 00:10:26,080
I'm afraid I can't watch it.

193
00:10:27,030 --> 00:10:27,670
Why?

194
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:30,480
Because

195
00:10:33,870 --> 00:10:35,800
I'm going to play the Flower Fairy!

196
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:39,580
Well...

197
00:10:39,870 --> 00:10:41,630
I'm going back to memorize my lines.

198
00:10:41,630 --> 00:10:42,720
I'll show you

199
00:10:42,740 --> 00:10:44,870
what a chosen leading lady looks like.

200
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:48,440
Slow down.

201
00:10:50,670 --> 00:10:51,530
I really didn't expect

202
00:10:51,530 --> 00:10:53,060
her to actually get picked.

203
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:55,290
I knew she would definitely get it.

204
00:10:56,550 --> 00:10:57,200
Since when

205
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,440
have you two been so in sync?

206
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,200
Didn't you use to fight

207
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:00,800
like cats and dogs every day?

208
00:11:02,100 --> 00:11:02,980
People change.

209
00:11:03,850 --> 00:11:05,120
The famous ancient Greek philosopher

210
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:06,630
Heraclitus once said,

211
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,540
"Everything flows."

212
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:09,660
"The only constant

213
00:11:10,030 --> 00:11:10,720
is change."

214
00:11:11,550 --> 00:11:13,050
I don't understand

215
00:11:13,070 --> 00:11:14,400
this Heraclitus stuff.

216
00:11:14,550 --> 00:11:15,870
And I don't know if he actually said that.

217
00:11:15,870 --> 00:11:16,320
But

218
00:11:16,670 --> 00:11:17,310
I do know

219
00:11:17,510 --> 00:11:19,510
you're definitely up to something.

220
00:11:19,950 --> 00:11:21,880
I'm just helping a

221
00:11:21,910 --> 00:11:23,720
confused classmate who

222
00:11:24,270 --> 00:11:25,030
can't face

223
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:26,660
her true feelings.

224
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:34,150
Lingzhi,

225
00:11:35,390 --> 00:11:36,120
look at you.

226
00:11:36,390 --> 00:11:37,910
Why are you hand-washing clothes here

227
00:11:37,910 --> 00:11:39,270
when you have a washing machine at home?

228
00:11:39,270 --> 00:11:39,870
Qinglian.

229
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:41,440
Come here.

230
00:11:42,630 --> 00:11:43,230
What is it?

231
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:44,550
Come on.

232
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,800
What good news do you have for me?

233
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,300
I've heard that

234
00:11:48,510 --> 00:11:49,480
Qi Shi

235
00:11:49,780 --> 00:11:51,380
is going to perform on stage.

236
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:52,970
Playing some kind of

237
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,320
Flower Fairy.

238
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:56,930
Tian Zihao told me all about it.

239
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,670
She didn't tell me.

240
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:02,080
You didn't know?

241
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:03,150
No.

242
00:12:05,880 --> 00:12:06,550
Don't blame me

243
00:12:06,550 --> 00:12:07,660
for saying this,

244
00:12:07,840 --> 00:12:09,840
but if Qi Shi goes on stage,

245
00:12:10,150 --> 00:12:12,010
the people who usually laugh at her

246
00:12:12,010 --> 00:12:13,210
will have a field day.

247
00:12:13,330 --> 00:12:14,440
Who dares to laugh at her?

248
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:15,960
She even dared to beat up

249
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:17,360
the mine director's son.

250
00:12:17,790 --> 00:12:19,270
T-T-That's different.

251
00:12:19,830 --> 00:12:21,130
The kids are older now.

252
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:21,840
A girl

253
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:23,750
needs her pride.

254
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:24,820
Think about it.

255
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:26,450
With hundreds of people

256
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:28,160
in the school auditorium

257
00:12:28,270 --> 00:12:30,530
waiting to see her make a fool of herself,

258
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:32,720
what if it traumatizes her?

259
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:36,800
Of course,

260
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:39,090
strictly speaking,

261
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,270
performing on stage

262
00:12:40,270 --> 00:12:42,100
is about showing what you can do.

263
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,440
Tian Zihao

264
00:12:44,550 --> 00:12:45,480
is different.

265
00:12:45,790 --> 00:12:47,030
He's got the height

266
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:48,270
and the looks.

267
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:50,600
But Qi Shi

268
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:52,210
gets gossiped about

269
00:12:52,530 --> 00:12:53,680
even at home,

270
00:12:53,790 --> 00:12:55,560
let alone on stage.

271
00:12:56,270 --> 00:12:57,840
You really need to think this through.

272
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:59,630
Just hurry up and wash your clothes.

273
00:12:59,630 --> 00:13:01,360
You need to think this through.

274
00:13:04,910 --> 00:13:05,640
Give it to me.

275
00:13:05,670 --> 00:13:06,670
Okay, okay, okay.

276
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:08,960
Stop busying yourself.

277
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:10,360
Come, sit down, sit down.

278
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:10,830
Okay.

279
00:13:12,810 --> 00:13:14,030
Time to eat! Time to eat!

280
00:13:14,030 --> 00:13:15,290
Aunt, drink some milk.

281
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:17,670
These are my last four bottles,

282
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:19,500
so let's drink them all today.

283
00:13:19,870 --> 00:13:20,860
Before we eat,

284
00:13:21,060 --> 00:13:22,060
I have a very

285
00:13:22,420 --> 00:13:24,080
important thing to announce.

286
00:13:25,550 --> 00:13:25,960
I...

287
00:13:26,780 --> 00:13:28,670
I'm going to play the Flower Fairy!

288
00:13:28,670 --> 00:13:29,320
Really?

289
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:33,880
You two...

290
00:13:34,360 --> 00:13:35,270
What's going on?

291
00:13:35,270 --> 00:13:36,870
What are those expressions?

292
00:13:38,670 --> 00:13:39,440
Honey,

293
00:13:40,390 --> 00:13:41,720
do you really have to go?

294
00:13:42,030 --> 00:13:43,690
You're already in 11th grade,

295
00:13:43,870 --> 00:13:45,360
and your studies are demanding.

296
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:45,720
