I appreciate it.

890
00:39:13,130 --> 00:39:14,990
The hurdles between our families

891
00:39:15,970 --> 00:39:17,670
can't be overcome with one meal

892
00:39:17,670 --> 00:39:18,630
and a drink.

893
00:39:21,000 --> 00:39:22,180
Our grudges

894
00:39:23,030 --> 00:39:24,920
are buried deeper than the chive filling

895
00:39:24,920 --> 00:39:26,050
in these dumplings.

896
00:39:27,630 --> 00:39:28,890
Let me make this clear.

897
00:39:29,410 --> 00:39:30,880
If our families were to make peace,

898
00:39:30,880 --> 00:39:31,630
it'd be like

899
00:39:33,070 --> 00:39:34,270
fishing in a dry well.

900
00:39:34,440 --> 00:39:35,170
Impossible.

901
00:39:35,630 --> 00:39:37,400
Alright, we've had enough
to eat and drink.

902
00:39:37,400 --> 00:39:38,200
Let's go home.

903
00:39:39,740 --> 00:39:40,350
Mrs. Huo.

904
00:39:40,440 --> 00:39:40,960
Cao Xin.

905
00:39:47,030 --> 00:39:47,800
You stay here

906
00:39:48,590 --> 00:39:49,650
and finish the cake

907
00:39:50,440 --> 00:39:51,900
with your grandpa and dad.

908
00:40:04,150 --> 00:40:04,630
Cao Xin,

909
00:40:05,440 --> 00:40:06,970
this is between the adults.

910
00:40:07,030 --> 00:40:08,890
You kids shouldn't get involved.

911
00:40:09,400 --> 00:40:10,550
It's too complicated to sort out

912
00:40:10,550 --> 00:40:11,480
or explain.

913
00:40:11,920 --> 00:40:12,770
If it's hard to explain,

914
00:40:12,770 --> 00:40:13,630
I don't see you adults

915
00:40:13,630 --> 00:40:15,030
talking about it directly either.

916
00:40:15,030 --> 00:40:16,360
Qi Shi and I are caught in the middle.

917
00:40:16,360 --> 00:40:17,620
What is this all about?

918
00:40:33,070 --> 00:40:34,360
The adult world

919
00:40:34,360 --> 00:40:35,820
is really something else.

920
00:40:39,480 --> 00:40:42,140
The grudge between our two families
is too deep.

921
00:40:42,920 --> 00:40:44,030
Making peace

922
00:40:45,770 --> 00:40:46,480
isn't as easy as

923
00:40:46,480 --> 00:40:47,550
we thought.

924
00:40:52,970 --> 00:40:54,230
Why do I have to celebrate my birthday

925
00:40:54,230 --> 00:40:55,800
with Cao Xin every year?

926
00:40:56,110 --> 00:40:57,570
Why can't we just buy a cake

927
00:40:57,840 --> 00:40:59,920
and celebrate at home like Zhi?

928
00:41:00,450 --> 00:41:01,410
You're so fussy.

929
00:41:01,450 --> 00:41:02,480
You two share the same birthday.

930
00:41:02,480 --> 00:41:04,120
It's more fun to celebrate together.

931
00:41:04,120 --> 00:41:04,850
Sweetie,

932
00:41:04,880 --> 00:41:05,880
come take a look at

933
00:41:06,190 --> 00:41:07,110
this.

934
00:41:07,880 --> 00:41:09,610
Here it comes. Come take a look.

935
00:41:09,630 --> 00:41:10,630
Here it is.

936
00:41:11,960 --> 00:41:12,620
Qi Zhi, come

937
00:41:12,760 --> 00:41:14,370
help Uncle Cao light the candles.

938
00:41:14,370 --> 00:41:15,230
You two birthday stars,

939
00:41:15,230 --> 00:41:16,070
make a wish.

940
00:41:18,550 --> 00:41:19,750
What did you wish for?

941
00:41:25,760 --> 00:41:27,480
Happy birthday!

942
00:41:27,480 --> 00:41:29,010
Come on, let's cut the cake.

943
00:41:29,710 --> 00:41:30,670
Come on.

944
00:41:33,670 --> 00:41:34,360
There we go.

945
00:41:34,760 --> 00:41:36,890
You're about to lose your front tooth.

946
00:41:38,000 --> 00:41:38,670
Give it to Qi Shi first.

947
00:41:38,670 --> 00:41:39,230
Okay,

948
00:41:39,230 --> 00:41:39,550
for Qi Shi.

949
00:41:39,550 --> 00:41:39,920
Okay,

950
00:41:40,360 --> 00:41:40,710
here.

951
00:41:40,760 --> 00:41:42,110
Here, this is for Cao Xin.

952
00:41:42,110 --> 00:41:42,880
Okay.

953
00:41:43,960 --> 00:41:44,630
And this one

954
00:41:44,840 --> 00:41:45,670
is for Qi Zhi.

955
00:41:45,760 --> 00:41:46,510
Okay, for Grandpa.

956
00:41:46,510 --> 00:41:47,510
For Grandpa.

957
00:41:47,510 --> 00:41:48,550
You're the elder.

958
00:41:48,550 --> 00:41:49,280
Here.

959
00:41:51,230 --> 00:41:52,370
Cao Xin!

960
00:41:52,400 --> 00:41:53,440
Take this out.

961
00:41:54,010 --> 00:41:54,840
Come back here!

962
00:41:54,840 --> 00:41:55,640
What's wrong?

963
00:41:58,120 --> 00:41:59,890
They are both nice people.

964
00:42:00,710 --> 00:42:02,290
Why do they have to fight?

965
00:42:04,890 --> 00:42:06,550
Do you think we'll be like them

966
00:42:06,880 --> 00:42:07,960
when we grow up?

967
00:42:14,550 --> 00:42:16,550
You'll definitely be like Mrs. Huo,

968
00:42:18,030 --> 00:42:19,480
always competitive,

969
00:42:21,030 --> 00:42:22,360
and never backing down.

970
00:42:24,760 --> 00:42:26,230
Then you'll definitely be like your dad,

971
00:42:26,230 --> 00:42:27,230
always scowling

972
00:42:27,760 --> 00:42:29,090
like our school's dean.

973
00:42:29,590 --> 00:42:30,850
I'm not like him at all.

974
00:42:38,760 --> 00:42:39,670
You... you

975
00:42:42,000 --> 00:42:42,400
You...

976
00:42:42,670 --> 00:42:44,470
Don't waste it. It's expensive.

977
00:42:46,440 --> 00:42:47,570
You wasted it first.

978
00:43:01,840 --> 00:43:02,760
What a birthday.
